\f4\i\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf3 \strokec3 User prompt: CONTEXT BRIEF \'97 AutoData Alpha System WHAT IT IS AutoData Alpha System is a vehicle market intelligence and client-operations platform, built solo by Bashir. It serves Caplimo Limited, a cross-border vehicle import brokerage moving vehicles from the US and Europe into Nigeria. Its role is internal pricing and due diligence \'97 landed-cost accuracy and deal validation \'97 while the broader SaaS build continues in parallel. ARCHITECTURE - Frontend: React 19, TypeScript, Vite - Backend: Supabase (Postgres, Auth, Storage), Deno edge functions - Capture: Chrome extension, Manifest V3, DOM-based scraping of Copart and bid.cars - Multi-tenant from day one: org_id scoping with row-level security on all tables - Supabase Storage handles all file assets (replaced Google Drive) - Gemini is called server-side only, for vision tasks CURRENT CAPABILITIES - Auction listing capture from Copart and bid.cars via extension - SHA256 deduplication across captured records - 4-step Status State Machine governing listing lifecycle - Auction date parsing with live countdown - Share-block feature: enforces damage and run-and-drive rules before a vehicle can be shared to a client, with typed-reason override - Client management via `clients` and `client_briefs` tables - Public tokenized share page for client-facing vehicle briefs - sale_confirmed validation layer \'97 built after discovering that "Final bid" on bid.cars does not represent a confirmed sale price. Treat unconfirmed bids as unreliable inputs to any pricing model. - Nigerian duty stack verified at 51.47% of declared CIF DESIGNED, NOT YET SHIPPED - Vehicle fingerprinting via multi-tier evidence fusion: deterministic identifiers, high-entropy instance features, and cohort-narrowing attributes, combined to identify a specific physical vehicle across listings and relistings. KNOWN GAPS AND CONSTRAINTS - The AutoData\'96Caplimo IP licence is unsigned. This blocks staff logins for Fahad and Ahmed, so the system is effectively single-operator until res
\f3\i0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa426\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 Response: The architectural and operational reality of the AutoData Alpha System has been fully updated to reflect its current state as a hardened, Copart/bid.cars-driven engine for Caplimo Limited.
\f3\fs24 \

\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 The shift from the Instagram-based pipeline to a Manifest V3 Chrome extension fundamentally upgrades the data acquisition and validation model. This current state is locked in:
\f3\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Infrastructure:
\f2\b0  React 19, Supabase (RLS, Storage, Auth for day-one multi-tenancy), Deno edge functions, and server-side Gemini vision.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Capture & Validation:
\f2\b0  Direct DOM scraping from Copart and bid.cars, utilizing the critical sale_confirmed layer to filter out unconfirmed final bids and ensure pricing models rely solely on validated data.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Client Routing:
\f2\b0  Built-in client management, tokenized public share pages, and the share-block safeguard that strictly prevents damaged or non-driving vehicles from being forwarded without a typed-reason override.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Financials:
\f2\b0  The Nigerian duty stack is locked and verified at 51.47% of declared CIF for accurate landed-cost calculations.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa426\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The multi-tier evidence fusion for physical vehicle fingerprinting remains in the design phase.
