\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 1. Vision Appraisal & Damage Judgment
\f3\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls13\ilvl0
\f0\b\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Problem:
\f2\b0  Copart listings often state "Primary Damage: Front End," but that could mean a cracked bumper ($800 fix) or sheared steering knuckles and bent A-pillars (total write-off).\
\ls13\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Agent Work:
\f2\b0  The agent receives 4\'966 high-res photos. It reasons through visual evidence:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls14\ilvl0
\f4\i \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Checklist inspection:
\f2\i0  Are steering wheel or side-curtain airbags blown? Are engine fluid reservoirs ruptured? Is the radiator core support pushed into the serpentine belt?\
\ls14\ilvl0
\f4\i \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Verdict:
\f2\i0  It generates a structured assessment: damage_severity_score (1-10), estimated_repair_complexity, and a rejection_reason (e.g., 
\f4\i "Structural shock tower damage detected \'97 violates Caplimo zero-frame-damage rule"
\f2\i0 ).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa426\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 2. Spec Discrepancy & Value Reconstruction
