\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls15\ilvl0
\f0\b\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Problem:
\f2\b0  Dealerships and auction yards frequently mislabel trims (e.g., calling a standard G 63 an "Edition 55" or missing rare options like the Night Package II / Carbon Trim that swing Nigerian resale by \uc0\u8358 10M\'96\u8358 25M).\
\ls15\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Agent Work:
\f2\b0  The agent calls a VIN decoding tool, compares factory build sheets against listing descriptions and visual badge placements, and resolves discrepancies to establish true market value.\
