\f0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 1. Implement a 3-Tier "Funnel" (Never Send Everything to Vision)
\f2\b0  Instead of passing every car to an LLM, use cheap programmatic filters first:
\f3\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls18\ilvl0
\f4\i\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Tier 1 (Regex/SQL - $0.00):
\f2\i0  Discard salvage titles, biohazard/flood tags, or non-target models instantly in code.\
\ls18\ilvl0
\f4\i \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Tier 2 (VIN Lookup - <$0.01):
\f2\i0  Fetch specs only for vehicles that pass Tier 1.\
\ls18\ilvl0
\f4\i \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Tier 3 (Vision LLM - ~$0.002):
\f2\i0  Only call Gemini 2.5 Flash on the top 10% of candidate vehicles that actually have pricing upside.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa426\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 2. Compress and Tile Images for Vision Inference
\f3\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls19\ilvl0
\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 High-res 4K images eat unnecessary vision tokens.\
\ls19\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Resize listing images to 
\f0\b 768\'d7768 or 1024\'d71024
\f2\b0  before sending them to the API, or stitch 4 angle shots into a single 2\'d72 image grid. This cuts your vision token usage by 
\f0\b 60\'9675%
\f2\b0  with zero loss in damage classification accuracy.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa426\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 3. Strict Deterministic Extraction vs. LLM Generation
\f3\b0\fs24 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
