\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 How They Get Data:
\f2\b0  Visor.vin operates large-scale crawler networks that ingest dealer website feeds (vAuto, Dealer.com, CDK Global), public marketplaces, and auction platforms. They normalize this into structured JSON (VIN, mileage, price history, dealer metadata, and media arrays).\
