\ls27\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Public Free Links:
\f2\b0  When a dealer embeds a free public Carfax/AutoCheck/Window Sticker badge on their website, aggregators often scrape and return the carfax_url or window_sticker_url in the listing metadata at no extra cost.\
