\f2\fs29\fsmilli14667 [User on Frontend]\uc0\u8232 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \u9474  (Searches "2022 GLE 450")\u8232 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \u9660 \u8232 [Supabase / PostgreSQL Ledger] \u9668 \u9472 \u9472  FAST (<50ms), FREE ($0.00)\u8232 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \u9474 \u8232  \'a0 (Vehicle Found?)\u8232  \'a0 \u9500 \u9472 \u9472  YES \u9472 \u9472 \u9658  Check `last_synced_at`\u8232  \'a0 \u9474  \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \u9500 \u9472 \u9472  < 24 Hours: Return cached landed cost instantly\u8232  \'a0 \u9474  \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \'a0 \u9492 \u9472 \u9472  > 24 Hours: Return cached data + trigger background re-sync\u8232  \'a0 \u9474 \u8232  \'a0 \u9492 \u9472 \u9472  NO \u9472 \u9472 \u9472 \u9658  Call Visor.vin API ($0.002) \u9472 \u9472 \u9658  Save to Supabase \u9472 \u9472 \u9658  Return to user\u8232 
